# Riba Iren (29018), a level 1 monster (440 HP), hit by a level 10 character, more than 8 levels
# above it: each hit makes it want its curse (4515) on the character at 1000000. A hit landing
# while it stands under half its HP, read before the hit's damage, also makes it want Orfen Heal
# (4516) on itself at 1000000: the hit of 300 finds it whole, the next one under a third. It
# draws nothing and adds no attack desire of its own.
character Hunter 10
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.orfen.OrfenPrivateRibaIren
npc riba 29018 Monster 100 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill HEAL 4516 1

hit riba 10
  desires riba cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
hit riba 300
  desires riba cast(player,4515,move)=2000000
hit riba 10
  desires riba cast(player,4515,move)=3000000 cast(riba,4516,move)=1000000
